{"unit_id":"SeerableOfficial__dsh-web-search-toggle#card-zh","repo":"SeerableOfficial/dsh-web-search-toggle","commit":"aff08de33f44ca2816ac7983aaa755c6723829e7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-toggle（DSH Web 插件）：它在聊天输入框的工具栏加入“Web Search”开关，供用户按会话启用或关闭联网搜索引导。开关状态通过主机 RPC 保存到本地文件，并在每次组装提示词时按当前会话注入搜索指令；浏览器本地状态用于快速显示。适合希望在特定对话中提醒 DSH 先搜索再回答的 Web 用户。需要 DSH web profile 和另行配置的 web_search 提供方；该插件本身不注册搜索工具。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:153-166","index.js:67-108"]}
{"unit_id":"SeerableOfficial__dsh-web-search-toggle#card-en","repo":"SeerableOfficial/dsh-web-search-toggle","commit":"aff08de33f44ca2816ac7983aaa755c6723829e7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-web-search-toggle adds a Web Search switch to the DSH Web composer. Users can enable search guidance per conversation; the host saves the setting and adds a directive during prompt assembly. It requires a DSH web profile and a configured web_search provider, which it does not supply.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:153-166","index.js:67-108"]}
