{"unit_id":"SeerableOfficial__dsh-web-search-toggle#feature-1","repo":"SeerableOfficial/dsh-web-search-toggle","commit":"aff08de33f44ca2816ac7983aaa755c6723829e7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-toggle 的功能「会话搜索开关」：在聊天输入框工具栏显示 Web Search 按钮，点击后切换当前会话的搜索引导状态。按钮通过主机 RPC 同步开关值。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:95-112","lib/client.js:159-165"]}
