{"unit_id":"SeerableOfficial__dsh-web-search-toggle#caveat-1","repo":"SeerableOfficial/dsh-web-search-toggle","commit":"aff08de33f44ca2816ac7983aaa755c6723829e7","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-toggle 使用系统提示词要求模型先搜索，但没有硬性拦截机制，是否调用 web_search 仍取决于模型遵循指令。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:37-44","index.js:99-107"]}
